# downloaded datasets and model weights (SSv2 chunks, CLIP/EgoVLP/ViCLIP weights)
hf_cache/
.cache/

# hand-off archives (superseded by the repo itself)
capstone_crvad.zip

# NOTE on large artefacts. These are gitignored but are REQUIRED to reproduce the
# probes, and cannot be regenerated on a GPU instance without the download step:
#   runs/ssv2_pairs.pt   ~606 MB  264 clips x 16 frames x 3x224x224 uint8
#   hf_cache/            ~872 MB  ViCLIP-B-16-hf snapshot (599 MB) + SSv2 shards
# To run on a remote GPU, either upload these separately (Kaggle dataset / Drive /
# scp) or rebuild them there: tools/fetch_viclip.py + ssv2_data.py take ~5 min each.
# Do NOT try to commit them -- 1.5 GB of binaries in git history is unmergeable.